> >>
> >> How to express the reply compactly in Lojban ?
> >
> >
> > Depending on what is being "me too"ed, you can use ji'a:
> >
> > abu: mi nelci ti
> > by: ji'a go'i
>
> {go'ira'o}, not {go'i}
>

No. It's just go'i.

The expansion on the above is not

abu: mi nelci ti
by: ji'a do nelci ti

It is

abu: mi nelci ti
by: ji'a mi nelci ti

ra'o is needed to distinguish between

A: mi lumci le mi karce
B: mi go'i

A: I wash my car.
B: I wash A=92s car.

and

A: mi lumci le mi karce
B: mi go'i ra'o

A: I wash my car.
B: I wash B=92s car.

